          "evidence": "Definition explicitly includes factor subset A=emptyset, whose column is the empty product x_emptyset=1. Its normalized coefficient is the run-response average2^{-k}sum_x y_x. The factorial EFFECT is restricted to nonempty A, so no undefined minus group is formed for the intercept."
