          "case": "iff-reverse",
          "status": "checked",
          "evidence": "Definition subset/sign encoding: given x in{-1,+1}^[k], take A={j:x_j=+1}. Rebuilding signs from membership in A returns x coordinatewise, proving the reverse recovery and the stated run/subset bijection."
        }
